    "summary": "For an **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** or **KEEPER OF SECRETS** model. Whenever the unit containing the bearer Advances, skip the **Advance roll**; instead its models add 6\" to their Move characteristic for the rest of the phase.\n\nWhen any model in that unit makes a **Normal move**, an **Advance move** or a **Fall Back move**, it:\n\n- may pass through enemy models\n- may enter **Engagement Range** of them but not finish the move there\n- passes any **Desperate Escape** test without rolling",
